    "liked": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-11T00:00:00Z",
    "html": "<button\n  class=\"group relative flex h-14 w-64 items-center justify-between border-4 border-black bg-black pl-6 pr-0 overflow-hidden\"\n>\n  <span\n    class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-0 bg-[#f3e05a] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out group-hover:w-full\"\n  ></span>\n\n  <span\n    class=\"relative z-10 font-sans text-sm font-black tracking-wider text-white transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-black\"\n  >\n    LET'S TALK\n  </span>\n\n  <span\n    class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full w-14 items-center justify-center bg-[#f3e05a] text-black\"\n  >\n    <svg\n      class=\"h-5 w-5 -rotate-45 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out group-hover:rotate-0\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      stroke=\"currentColor\"\n      stroke-width=\"2.5\"\n      viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n    >\n      <path\n        stroke-linecap=\"square\"\n        stroke-linejoin=\"miter\"\n        d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"\n      ></path>\n    </svg>\n  </span>\n</button>\n",
