    "html": "<button class=\"button\">\n  <p class=\"button__text\">\n    <span style=\"--index: 0;\">T</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 1;\">W</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 2;\">I</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 3;\">T</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 4;\">T</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 5;\">E</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 6;\">R</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 7;\"> </span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 8;\">T</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 9;\">W</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 10;\">I</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 11;\">T</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 12;\">T</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 13;\">E</span>\n    <span style=\"--index: 14;\">R</span>\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"button__circle\">\n    <svg\n      viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n      class=\"button__icon\"\n      width=\"25\"\n    >\n      <path\n        d=\"M5.026 15c6.038 0 9.341-5.003 9.341-9.334 0-.14 0-.282-.006-.422A6.685 6.685 0 0 0 16 3.542a6.658 6.658 0 0 1-1.889.518 3.301 3.301 0 0 0 1.447-1.817 6.533 6.533 0 0 1-2.087.793A3.286 3.286 0 0 0 7.875 6.03a9.325 9.325 0 0 1-6.767-3.429 3.289 3.289 0 0 0 1.018 4.382A3.323 3.323 0 0 1 .64 6.575v.045a3.288 3.288 0 0 0 2.632 3.218 3.203 3.203 0 0 1-.865.115 3.23 3.23 0 0 1-.614-.057 3.283 3.283 0 0 0 3.067 2.277A6.588 6.588 0 0 1 .78 13.58a6.32 6.32 0 0 1-.78-.045A9.344 9.344 0 0 0 5.026 15z\"\n        fill=\"currentColor\"\n      ></path>\n    </svg>\n\n    <svg\n      viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      width=\"25\"\n      xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n      class=\"button__icon button__icon--copy\"\n    >\n      <path\n        d=\"M5.026 15c6.038 0 9.341-5.003 9.341-9.334 0-.14 0-.282-.006-.422A6.685 6.685 0 0 0 16 3.542a6.658 6.658 0 0 1-1.889.518 3.301 3.301 0 0 0 1.447-1.817 6.533 6.533 0 0 1-2.087.793A3.286 3.286 0 0 0 7.875 6.03a9.325 9.325 0 0 1-6.767-3.429 3.289 3.289 0 0 0 1.018 4.382A3.323 3.323 0 0 1 .64 6.575v.045a3.288 3.288 0 0 0 2.632 3.218 3.203 3.203 0 0 1-.865.115 3.23 3.23 0 0 1-.614-.057 3.283 3.283 0 0 0 3.067 2.277A6.588 6.588 0 0 1 .78 13.58a6.32 6.32 0 0 1-.78-.045A9.344 9.344 0 0 0 5.026 15z\"\n        fill=\"currentColor\"\n      ></path>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</button>\n",
    "css": ".button {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: none;\n  background: #00ccff;\n  color: #fff;\n  width: 100px;\n  height: 100px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  display: grid;\n  place-content: center;\n  transition:\n    background 300ms,\n    transform 200ms;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.button__text {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  animation: text-rotation 8s linear infinite;\n\n  > span {\n    position: absolute;\n    transform: rotate(calc(22deg * var(--index)));\n    inset: 7px;\n  }\n}\n\n.button__circle {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 40px;\n  height: 40px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #212121;\n  color: #00ccff;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.button__icon--copy {\n  position: absolute;\n  transform: translate(-150%, 150%);\n}\n\n.button:hover {\n  background: #000;\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n}\n\n.button:hover .button__icon {\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.button:hover .button__icon:first-child {\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease-in-out;\n  transform: translate(150%, -150%);\n}\n\n.button:hover .button__icon--copy {\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease-in-out 0.1s;\n  transform: translate(0);\n}\n\n@keyframes text-rotation {\n  to {\n    rotate: 360deg;\n  }\n}\n\n.button:active {\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n}\n"
