    "createdAt": "2026-09-11T00:00:00Z",
    "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-2 sm:p-4 md:p-6\">\n  <article\n    class=\"w-full max-w-xl bg-white rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg sm:shadow-xl transform transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-2xl group\"\n  >\n    <div class=\"p-3 sm:p-4\">\n      <span\n        class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1.5 sm:px-4 sm:py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-full\"\n      >\n        Technology\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 mb-4\">\n        <div\n          class=\"w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full ring-2 ring-indigo-100 overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0\"\n        >\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\">\n            <defs>\n              <linearGradient\n                y2=\"100%\"\n                x2=\"100%\"\n                y1=\"0%\"\n                x1=\"0%\"\n                id=\"avatarGradient\"\n              >\n                <stop style=\"stop-color:#93C5FD\" offset=\"0%\"></stop>\n                <stop style=\"stop-color:#3B82F6\" offset=\"100%\"></stop>\n              </linearGradient>\n            </defs>\n            <rect fill=\"url(#avatarGradient)\" height=\"40\" width=\"40\"></rect>\n            <circle opacity=\"0.9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" r=\"8\" cy=\"16\" cx=\"20\"></circle>\n            <path\n              opacity=\"0.9\"\n              fill=\"#FFFFFF\"\n              d=\"M6 40c0-8 6-12 14-12s14 4 14 12\"\n            ></path>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900\">\n            Manish Tamang\n          </h3>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Senior Tech Writer</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <h2\n        class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 sm:mb-4 leading-tight group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\"\n      >\n        The Future of Web Development: Trends to Watch in 2024\n        <div\n          class=\"h-0.5 w-full bg-indigo-600 transform origin-left scale-x-0 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-x-100\"\n        ></div>\n      </h2>\n\n      <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 mb-4 sm:mb-6 line-clamp-3\">\n        Discover the emerging trends that are shaping the future of web\n        development. From AI-powered tools to new frameworks, learn what's next\n        in the world of coding and how it will impact the way we build\n        applications.\n      </p>\n      <div\n        class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-0 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500\">\n            <svg\n              stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n              stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 sm:w-4 sm:h-4\"\n            >\n              <circle r=\"10\" cy=\"12\" cx=\"12\"></circle>\n              <polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline>\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm\">5 min read</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500\">\n            <svg\n              stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n              stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 sm:w-4 sm:h-4\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"\n              ></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm\">24 comments</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <button\n          class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-600 font-medium hover:text-indigo-700 text-sm sm:text-base\"\n        >\n          Read More\n          <svg\n            stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n            stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n            stroke-width=\"2\"\n            stroke=\"currentColor\"\n            fill=\"none\"\n            viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n            xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n            class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 sm:w-4 sm:h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5\"\n          >\n            <line y2=\"7\" x2=\"17\" y1=\"17\" x1=\"7\"></line>\n            <polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</div>\n",
